  "notes": "The archetype's soul-and-blues wing — country, blues and southern soul in one band, with the sourced characterisation \"an impressive calling card, full of Crockett's plaintive soulfulness and swinging tempos\" and a \"clipped, hiccuped Texan drawl\". The load-bearing drum instruction is explicit and is the one parameter that separates this model from every other in the section: \"snare dry and slightly behind the beat — model a laid-back micro-timing offset here (the opposite of the anticipated bluegrass feel in `country-train`), because that lag is what produces the soul lope\". That is snare.offGridMs +8 with humanize loosened to 0.64/0.24 and the snare's jitter raised to 9 ms; the rest of the kit is the entry's shuffled two-beat or quarter-kick swing \"with the lope on a ride\", so the inherited ride lane carries 5–9 hits and the hat sits back at 0.30. Harmony is the entry's own frame: twelve-bar blues in all its sourced variants including the shuffle-blues V–IV–I–I cadence and the minor i7 / iv7 / ♭VI7–V7 form, plus soul-derived I–vi–IV–V and ii–V–I turnarounds — the research states the reason (\"his documented early exposure to soul via hip-hop samples … is the reason the harmony leans soul rather than pure honky-tonk\"), so the seventh weighting is high at 0.5. The bass carries the same split — walking quarters on the swing material, shuffled two-beat on the honky-tonk cuts, and \"a soul-derived syncopated figure with anticipations before the downbeat on the R&B-leaning tracks\" — which is independent_riff at 0.74 with anticipationProb 0.30. The vocal is \"mid-baritone, blues- and soul-phrased with heavy back-phrasing, the documented 'clipped, hiccuped' consonant attack as the signature ornament, and mid-to-high syllabic density\": staccato, endVariation on, a blues half-step colour at 0.12. ⚠ ALL tempo numbers are INFERRED, as the research states outright — \"bpmdatabase returned no records; band inferred from the documented 'swinging tempos' characterisation and the archetype grammar\" — so 90–160 and mode 120 are both [LOW-CONF]. ⚠ Also INFERRED: swing.amount 0.65, the +8 ms lag value (the research gives the direction, not a number), all velocity tiers and the kit densities.",
